        {
          "id": 3067694334,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "I didn't notice this because `set_ext{cap,log}_executable_properties()` covers Windows and macOS while `install()` covers POSIX. We might want to move the `install()` calls to `set_ext{cap,log}_executable_properties()` to reduce the chances of mismatches in the future.",
